1
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:38,210
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:40,930
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,120
Alright.

4
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,039
1 to 99, right?

5
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,930
It should be pretty simple.

6
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,120
Let me give it a try.

7
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,000
Xiaotao, you can do it first.

8
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,880
I... 46.

9
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,560
1 to 46.

10
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,840
43.

11
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,919
43 to 46.

12
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,680
45.

13
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:22,280
[45]

14
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,720
Senior, you got it.

15
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,720
Come on. Let me ask.

16
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,650
Put your hand in.

17
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,760
How many romantic relationships
have you had?

18
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:42,180
What kind of question is that? Let me ask.

19
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:43,800
Senior,

20
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:46,000
since you are so popular at school,

21
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,920
do you have someone you like?

22
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:52,920
Yes.

23
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,640
Who is it?

24
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,520
I've just answered a question.

25
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,720
As for this question,

26
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,480
I'll answer it when I lose next time.

27
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,480
Alright. Next one.

28
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,600
Do you like Le Xiaotao?

29
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,400
Senior.

30
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,520
Yes or no?

31
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,520
Yes, I like her.

32
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,050
But not in the way you think.

33
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,120
36.

34
00:03:51,010 --> 00:03:52,020
[36]

35
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,400
You got it.

36
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,800
Let me ask.

37
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,680
Is there a girl

38
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,610
who you've liked since childhood?

39
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,079
No.

40
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,080
Senior, does it hurt?

41
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,000
No.

42
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,440
Why do I feel a bit hot?

43
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,640
T-Turn down the air-conditioner a bit.

44
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,220
-The remote control.
-Right.

45
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,970
W-What would you like to drink?

46
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,840
I have everything at home.

47
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,480
Get me a can of cola.

48
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,010
-Thank you.
-I'll go get it.

49
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,290
I want a cold one.

50
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,220
I'm going to the restroom.

51
00:05:34,409 --> 00:05:35,810
[Basketball Training Plan]

52
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,680
[Basketball Training Plan]

53
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,270
[Basketball Training Plan]

54
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:51,870
[Basketball Training Plan]

55
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,060
What are you doing?

56
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,080
I...

57
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,880
I want to go to the restroom.

58
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,260
It's next door.

59
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,330
What's wrong, Xiangxiang?

60
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,200
Nothing.

61
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:55,740
I might just be
a little tired from playing the game.

62
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:57,940
We're leaving.

63
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,340
-Let's go.
-Take care.

64
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,680
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

65
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,480
You fouled.

66
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,540
Go get the ball now.

67
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:01,960
Hui!

68
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,000
-Hui.
-Hui.

69
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,700
-When did you come back?
-Hui.

70
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,080
I just came back.

71
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,880
Did you miss me?

72
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,280
Of course, Hui.

73
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,760
Hui, in this half a year
when you were away,

74
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:12,680
our living standards dropped drastically.

75
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,640
Yeah.

76
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,560
By the way,
how long are you staying this time?

77
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,000
This time, I should be able to stay

78
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,640
until after your national tournament.

79
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:21,240
That's great.

80
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,680
That's great. That's great.

81
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,400
Ms. Tang.

82
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:25,360
You're back from abroad
with such little stuff?

83
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:29,020
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

84
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:26,880
Come on, Chen Yu.

85
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:27,840
Help Hui put this away.

86
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:28,440
Sure.

87
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,760
Come on, Yunze, Zhou Li, Wang Yi.

88
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:36,039
Come here. Let me introduce her to you.

89
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,720
This is our team manager, Tang Hui.

90
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,360
She just came back
from a six-month study program in the US.

91
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,960
Tang Hui, this is Zhou Yunze,

92
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,919
our starting center and a freshman.

93
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,919
Zhou Li, Wang Yi.

94
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,640
All three of them are freshmen.

95
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,970
What are you waiting for?
Say hello to Hui.

96
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:48,800
-Hello, Hui.
-Hello, Hui.

97
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:51,600
Hello, everyone.
I hope we can work together well.

98
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,360
Chen Xiaojun!

99
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,560
How did you get

100
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,640
so muscular in these six months?

101
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,560
Of course.

102
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,800
Gu Han, who are those students?

103
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,200
They are from the campus TV station,

104
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,760
and they're here to shoot a documentary
about our team.

105
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,720
This is Zhou Xiangxiang,

106
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,960
a freshman from the Chinese Department.

107
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:13,090
She's currently Gu Han's partner
in an elective course.

108
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,680
Hello, Xiangxiang.

109
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,560
I'm Tang Hui.

110
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,300
Hello, Senior.

111
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,480
Thank you.

112
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,560
Gu Han, isn't Coach Pei here?

113
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,680
He has something to do this morning.

114
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:29,210
We're practicing by ourselves
this morning.

115
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,410
Let's continue.

116
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:33,480
-Hui, see you later.
-Let's chat later.

117
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,760
Gu Han,

118
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,920
tell me
about our team's current training plan.

119
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:39,250
I learned quite many new systems
in the US.

120
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,560
Have some water, guys.

121
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:44,010
Thank you.

122
00:09:44,010 --> 00:09:45,040
-Thank you, Senior.
-You're welcome.

123
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:45,720
Alright.

124
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,280
Shoot this scene.

125
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,200
Here, guys. Xiangxiang.

126
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,720
-Thank you, Senior.
-That's good.

127
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,380
-Come on.
-Thank you, Senior.

128
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:55,800
Xiangxiang.

129
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,500
-How long have you been filming here?
-Next.

130
00:09:58,920 --> 00:09:59,640
Keep up.

131
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,280
It's been a while.

132
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,800
No one is bullying you, right?

133
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,240
Speed up. Continue.

134
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,800
-As you know...
-Good.

135
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,240
Come on.

136
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,320
-Gu Han is known for his bad temper.
-Wang Yi.

137
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,720
He just doesn't like interviews

138
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,400
-or filming.
-Do it one more time.

139
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:15,080
He thinks having a camera here

140
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,760
would affect the training progress.

141
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,670
Next.

142
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,080
We'll try not to disturb you guys.

143
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,640
It's fine.

144
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:21,000
Come on.

145
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,800
Just tell me.

146
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,000
If he's hard to deal with, I'll help you.

147
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,560
Come on.

148
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:32,700
Alright. Dismissed.

149
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:36,720
Hui, what do you want to eat tonight?

150
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:39,920
You don't need to arrange it.
I've got it covered.

151
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,720
This is typical of you, Ms. Tang.

152
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,400
Xiangxiang, go with us, too.

153
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,080
I won't go.

154
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,560
Come on. Don't be shy. Let's go.

155
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:55,960
Alright. Let me put my stuff away first.

156
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,580
It smells good.

157
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,360
Chen Yu, your sugar-free cola.

158
00:11:12,640 --> 00:11:13,770
You know me the best.

159
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:16,160
Sirui, your favorite kidneys.

160
00:11:17,220 --> 00:11:18,280
Keep it low-key.

161
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,280
Hui, you're so thoughtful.

162
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:24,540
You remember what everyone likes to eat.

163
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:29,310
Hui.

164
00:11:29,350 --> 00:11:32,720
You've ordered this clear broth
specifically for our captain, right?

165
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,560
I can't help it.

166
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:34,760
Gu Han is different from you guys.

167
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:36,120
He's the most principled.

168
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:39,180
He absolutely won't touch things
that he doesn't like.

169
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:44,040
Come on.
Let's all have a drink with Hui.

170
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,410
-Come on.
-Okay.

171
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,560
Welcome back to the team.

172
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,160
-Welcome back to the team.
-Wait for me!

173
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:48,960
Cheers!

174
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,140
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

175
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,000
I've found that American universities

176
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,000
really value sports clubs greatly.

177
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,680
Not only do they
have a reward and punishment system,

178
00:11:57,680 --> 00:12:00,340
but they also
have a specific metric called APR.

179
00:12:00,470 --> 00:12:01,370
APR?

180
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:04,320
It stands for Academic Progress Rate.

181
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,640
In particular, the academic performance

182
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:09,160
is one of the main factors affecting APR.

183
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,480
The academic performances
of the team members

184
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,520
determine the calculation
of APR within the team.

185
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,240
This way, the school can clearly see

186
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,000
the academic status of the team members.

187
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,160
If they don't meet the standards,

188
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:18,420
they will be punished.

189
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,080
If I were there,

190
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,520
wouldn't I be punished every day?

191
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,320
You should reflect on yourself.

192
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,280
How dare you
have the nerve to criticize me?

193
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:27,440
In terms of what you've said,

194
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:29,960
American universities
are indeed quite strict.

195
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,720
But if it's for a competition,

196
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,760
skipping classes

197
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,840
is also quite fun.

198
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,200
I remember when we first joined the team
in our freshman year,

199
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,120
before a match,

200
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,320
everyone skipped classes

201
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,440
and trained like crazy.

202
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,720
Our captain practiced all night long,

203
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:44,120
and the rest of us all fell asleep
next to him.

204
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,280
I remember that.

205
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:47,440
Back then, Hui was the only one
who stayed with our captain,

206
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,240
picking up the balls
and passing them to him

207
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:49,960
until dawn.

208
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,440
How dare you guys
have the nerve to say that?

209
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,760
Back then, the snores of you three

210
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:54,120
were so loud

211
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,760
that the whole gym could hear them.

212
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:58,080
How could you bear to
let the captain practice alone?

213
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:00,160
Only you couldn't bear it, right?

214
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:02,020
Let's keep eating. I'm starving.

215
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,730
I'll go get some fruits.

216
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:12,620
This stuff is quite spicy.

217
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:15,480
Hui.

218
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,680
You haven't had the authentic hot pot
in a long time, right?

219
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,720
Thanks, Sirui.

220
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,320
Aren't you interested in

221
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:34,250
what they were just talking about?

222
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,450
I'm interested.

223
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:38,120
I think what Hui said
was quite interesting.

224
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,040
It can actually offer some

225
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,900
indirect help to my documentary.

226
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:43,580
Hui, let me cook some meat for you.

227
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,880
Okay.

228
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,480
We have a practice match tomorrow morning.

229
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,140
Will you guys come and film it?

230
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:53,960
Sure.

231
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:57,320
Try this.

232
00:13:58,560 --> 00:13:59,320
Thank you.

233
00:13:59,490 --> 00:14:00,350
Give this to me.

234
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,000
This is super spicy, right?

235
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,060
It's mildly spicy.

236
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,200
Mildly spicy.

237
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,240
You're so weak.

238
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,640
No, no, I'd better...

239
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,640
I'll put the meat in here.

240
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:18,920
My kidneys.

241
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:21,040
It's still a bit spicy.

242
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,570
-What is this?
-Put it here.

243
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,440
Come on.

244
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,320
-Let's have another drink.
-Come on.

245
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,040
-Come on.
-Okay.

246
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:30,680
Come on.

247
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:33,360
Cheers.

248
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,960
Bottoms up.

249
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:40,350
[Shanshiqi]

250
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,520
-We should drink more.
-Let's continue.

251
00:14:42,520 --> 00:14:44,200
Shall we go to a KTV club or get a drink?

252
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,200
It's up to you.

253
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,160
Both are okay.

254
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,480
It's rare for Hui to be back.

255
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:49,280
We must have as much fun as we can.

256
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:50,920
I'm not going.

257
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,370
I still have homework to do.

258
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:56,560
Well, it's late now.

259
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,160
Can one of you take her home?

260
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:01,080
It's okay. I can go home by myself.

261
00:15:02,290 --> 00:15:02,770
-Bye bye.
-Bye bye.

262
00:15:02,770 --> 00:15:03,680
Bye bye.

263
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,480
Then let's go singing.

264
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,480
I'm not going, either.

265
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,520
I'm a little tired.

266
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:11,080
Guys, entertain Hui properly.
The bill is on me.

267
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,000
Stay a little longer.

268
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:13,040
It's rare for Hui to be back.

269
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,000
It's okay.

270
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,680
Let him go back and rest.

271
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,780
Anyway,
we still have group training tomorrow.

272
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,570
I'll get going then.

273
00:15:20,570 --> 00:15:25,230
[Late Night Restaurant, Open 24/7]

274
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,480
-Take care.
-Bye bye.

275
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,280
Bye bye.

276
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,000
Let's go singing.

277
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:26,560
Let's go.

278
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:27,760
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

279
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:43,680
Get in.

280
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:50,480
So you're not
going to the next place with them?

281
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:53,880
I need to go back to get something.
Let's go.

282
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,280
The seatbelt.

283
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,440
One bottle for each of us.

284
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,400
Okay. Thanks.

285
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:24,080
I've noticed that you guys
seem pretty close to Xiangxiang.

286
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,080
Sort of.

287
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,560
We just hung out with her

288
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:28,620
and her roommates a few times before.

289
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,120
I've noticed that Gu Han
seems quite close to her, too.

290
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,320
How did they meet?

291
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:35,400
Hui,

292
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,160
while you were away,

293
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:39,040
you missed many exciting dramas.

294
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,400
When our captain and Xiangxiang first met,

295
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:42,880
he ended up in the police station.

296
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:43,600
Right.

297
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,320
And that tiny injury on his leg

298
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,200
became known to the whole school.

299
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:50,280
Those girls
come to deliver medicine every day.

300
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,720
We couldn't train at all.

301
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,240
Come on. Let's drink.

302
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:58,400
Logically speaking,
our captain should hate her.

303
00:16:58,400 --> 00:16:59,460
But unexpectedly,

304
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,560
our captain
not only agreed to be interviewed by her

305
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:03,760
but also injured his arm to protect her.

306
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:04,880
That's right.

307
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,319
Now they are also classmates

308
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:08,000
in the Classical Literature Class.

309
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,359
They even need to
write poems to each other.

310
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:11,440
What are you doing?

311
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,859
Hui, welcome back to the team.

312
00:17:14,119 --> 00:17:15,280
Let's drink together.

313
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:15,800
Okay.

314
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:20,720
Guys, just go ahead.

315
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,400
I'll go order some more food.

316
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,040
Okay.

317
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,160
What's going on with you two?

318
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,490
Can't you read the room?

319
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:33,040
From now on, in front of Tang Hui,
try not to mention

320
00:17:33,040 --> 00:17:36,000
the relationship
between Xiangxiang and our captain.

321
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:36,880
What's wrong?

322
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:42,810
I have a vague feeling
that a big war is about to break out.

323
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,280
What big war?

324
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:48,960
So this Tang Hui

325
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,240
is really Gu Han's

326
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,570
childhood sweetheart?

327
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,640
But why do I feel that

328
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:56,320
this Tang Hui
is not someone to be trifled with?

329
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,760
However,

330
00:17:59,040 --> 00:17:59,960
after all, she's Gu Han's childhood friend

331
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,890
that he has liked since he was a kid.

332
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,000
I...

333
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,760
Make it clear.

334
00:18:05,800 --> 00:18:08,840
"How am I, Zhou Xiangxiang,
not good enough for Gu Han?"

335
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:10,200
I think this situation

336
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,160
might turn around.

337
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:12,680
It was supposed to be
a welcome dinner for Tang Hui,

338
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,480
but Gu Han still brought you back.

339
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:17,280
This shows
that their relationship is just so-so.

340
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,100
Don't lose your momentum.

341
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,240
I agree.

342
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,880
You have to take the initiative in love.

343
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,680
There's nothing to be afraid of.

344
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,800
I'm not afraid of anything else,

345
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,730
but I'm just afraid that...

346
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,620
What are you afraid of?

347
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:38,090
I'm just afraid
that Tang Hui might be a pick-me girl.

348
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:40,380
If so, that would be a tricky problem.

349
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:48,200
Come on! Gather around!

350
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:48,800
Come on.

351
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:50,120
That's it for the morning training.

352
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,680
Later, just take a break first.

353
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,600
We'll do group scrimmages
in the afternoon.

354
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:54,350
-Got it?
-Got it.

355
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:55,320
-Got it.
-Got it.

356
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:56,240
Alright. Dismissed.

357
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:56,960
Is there still enough battery?

358
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:58,160
-Thank you, Coach.
-It can still last for three hours.

359
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:59,080
Don't leave yet, everyone.

360
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:00,440
I've bought coffee for you all.

361
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,280
I'm late today.

362
00:19:01,280 --> 00:19:02,440
I haven't got over the jet lag yet.

363
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,440
Help yourselves.

364
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,800
-Thank you.
-Thank you, Hui.

365
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,350
You're welcome.

366
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,320
-Thank you, Hui.
-Thank you, Hui.

367
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:06,800
Not at all.

368
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:08,120
-Give more close-ups to the team members.
-I want this.

369
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:08,720
Thanks, Hui.

370
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,400
Gu Han.

371
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,000
Yours is here.

372
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,200
-I want to swap with you.
-Okay.

373
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:12,880
Thank you.

374
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:19,650
Shoot more of this kind of scene.

375
00:19:19,650 --> 00:19:21,400
Guys, your coffee.

376
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:22,560
-Distribute it yourselves.
-Thank you.

377
00:19:22,560 --> 00:19:23,320
Thank you.

378
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,160
There are only three cups here.

379
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,200
Xiangxiang, you can drink this one.

380
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,400
I'm sorry, Xiangxiang.

381
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,720
-I just forgot to grab one of them.
-Ours...

382
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,600
-You can drink mine.
-They're different, too.

383
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:31,280
You...

384
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:32,040
Are they different?

385
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:32,740
You...

386
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,720
The 1st way of identifying a pick-me girl—

387
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,920
Playing the good guy.

388
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,920
It's okay.

389
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:39,880
I haven't drunk it yet.

390
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:41,080
You can drink it. Don't be shy.

391
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,000
It's really fine.

392
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:42,930
You can drink it.

393
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,500
Did you get burned?

394
00:19:48,500 --> 00:19:49,920
I really didn't mean it.

395
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:51,480
-It's not that serious.
-Look over there.

396
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,320
I'll be fine after rinsing it.

397
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:54,320
I haven't finished drinking it yet.

398
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,170
Look over there.

399
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,800
Xiangxiang, don't be angry.

400
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,320
I really didn't mean it.

401
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,720
The 2nd way of identifying a pick-me girl—

402
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,920
Playing innocent.

403
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:09,520
It's fine.

404
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:20,770
I'll go check on her.

405
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:30,560
[REPAIR IN PROGRESS]

406
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:47,120
Xiangxiang.

407
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,360
I'm sorry.

408
00:20:49,310 --> 00:20:50,120
What?

409
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:51,920
I said I'm sorry

410
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,490
for dirtying your clothes.

411
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:54,560
It's fine.

412
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,400
Do you come to
every training session of our team?

413
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,200
If so, I'll make a note of it.

414
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,360
Next time, if there's anything,

415
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:04,890
I'll save a portion for you.

416
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:08,680
It's okay.
You don't have to worry about me.

417
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:16,080
I've noticed that Gu Han
takes quite good care of you.

418
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:18,340
Have you known each other for a long time?

419
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:22,120
Not so long.

420
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:25,890
It's just that I've troubled Senior
with something before.

421
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:27,680
I see.

422
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:28,640
No wonder.

423
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,560
I've known Gu Han for many years,

424
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:33,290
but I've never seen him
care so much about anyone.

425
00:21:33,760 --> 00:21:35,490
But maybe I'm overthinking it.

426
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,000
You are his junior after all,

427
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,280
and you're here from the TV station
to shoot a documentary,

428
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:42,680
so it's only right
that he takes care of you.

429
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:45,320
I can only say that Gu Han

430
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:46,580
has become mature.

431
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,480
Xiangxiang.

432
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,760
I'm a straightforward person.

433
00:21:55,760 --> 00:21:56,960
Please don't mind it.

434
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:00,840
Over these years, I've seen too many girls

435
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:02,640
get hurt because they liked him.

436
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,720
But Gu Han

437
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:05,640
is the kind of person

438
00:22:05,640 --> 00:22:07,700
who doesn't easily fall for someone.

439
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:09,890
You know what I mean, right?

440
00:22:16,960 --> 00:22:17,840
I'm sorry.

441
00:22:18,040 --> 00:22:19,640
I didn't know it was broken.

442
00:22:29,720 --> 00:22:31,320
What's going on with you two?

443
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:54,200
No need. It's not very wet.

444
00:22:58,080 --> 00:22:58,800
Wipe it.

445
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:07,720
Xiangxiang.

446
00:23:08,120 --> 00:23:09,640
Are you still angry at me?

447
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,250
I really didn't mean it.

448
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:13,960
I'll definitely order it
for you next time.

449
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,560
Alright.

450
00:23:19,040 --> 00:23:21,040
Wipe it first and take a rest over there.

451
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:22,500
We're going to train soon.

452
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:51,080
His data isn't good enough.

453
00:23:51,080 --> 00:23:52,600
I think our positions
need to be more spread out.

454
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:53,440
-Okay. Ask someone else to guard him.
-What about you?

455
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,160
I think next time,

456
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,480
we can let Kong Fang
try with the blue team.

457
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,680
-Okay. Let's switch.
-Let's switch.

458
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:58,480
Guys, thanks for your hard work.

459
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:04,400
Thank you all
for your cooperation recently.

460
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,080
I'd like to treat you all to milk tea.

461
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,440
Thank you.

462
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,120
This is

463
00:24:11,120 --> 00:24:13,720
Senior Chen's favorite Taro Boba Milk Tea

464
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:14,680
without taro.

465
00:24:15,560 --> 00:24:16,560
Thanks, Xiangxiang.

466
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:18,120
And Senior Kong's

467
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,800
Taro Boba Milk Tea without boba.

468
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:21,660
Thanks. You remember so clearly.

469
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:23,880
Senior Li's Iced Coffee with Milk Tea.

470
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,210
You're so adept at this.

471
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,840
Senior Gu's Strawberry Boba.

472
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,240
Thanks.

473
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,640
You guys can share the rest.

474
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:33,440
Thank you.

475
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:36,120
Then I'll go give them to everyone.

476
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:37,040
Can you carry them all?

477
00:24:37,040 --> 00:24:37,920
Thanks, Xiangxiang.

478
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:38,680
-You're welcome.
-Thank you.

479
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,400
Thank you.

480
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,360
She even knows I don't want sugar.

481
00:24:42,360 --> 00:24:43,290
Let's continue.

482
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:45,400
Come on.

483
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,080
Senior.

484
00:24:47,040 --> 00:24:48,760
I don't know what you like to drink,

485
00:24:48,760 --> 00:24:50,420
so I just ordered a random one.

486
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:17,840
Xiangxiang, you're so impressive.

487
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:20,480
Your veiled attack was really brilliant.

488
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:21,800
I couldn't even identify
if you were dissing a pick-me girl

489
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:22,880
or Tang Hui.

490
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:25,120
I had thought she was pretty classy.

491
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:27,480
I didn't expect her to be this low-tier.

492
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:31,360
In your opinions,

493
00:25:31,560 --> 00:25:33,960
if I keep treating Tang Hui like this,

494
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:36,250
what will Gu Han think of me?

495
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:37,920
After all,

496
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:40,040
they have a special relationship.

497
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:42,120
You only saw a photo

498
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:43,760
in Gu Han's room.

499
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:47,340
You just can't confirm their relationship
based on that, huh?

500
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:50,000
In my opinion, just stop guessing

501
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,330
and ask Gu Han directly.

502
00:25:51,520 --> 00:25:52,520
What should I ask?

503
00:25:52,520 --> 00:25:53,880
Ask him if he likes Tang Hui

504
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:55,000
or you.

505
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,560
Are you crazy? That's too direct.

506
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:58,680
Then just ask him indirectly.

507
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,080
The key is to ask Gu Han

508
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:02,010
how he really feels about Tang Hui.

509
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:03,610
I think that's okay.

510
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,330
Are you feeling better now?

511
00:26:29,840 --> 00:26:30,760
Much better.

512
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:32,600
Eat it.

513
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:44,750
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

514
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,440
Are you okay?

515
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:07,560
No, I'm still dizzy.

516
00:27:08,320 --> 00:27:09,400
This is not hypoglycemia.

517
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:11,600
I'll take you to the hospital. Let's go.

518
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:13,080
I can go by myself.

519
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:16,320
Don't you
have an interview with Xiangxiang?

520
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:19,050
It's fine. We can do it another day.

521
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:20,920
Let's go.

522
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,420
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

523
00:27:27,080 --> 00:27:27,840
Be careful.

524
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,570
Are you still dizzy?

525
00:27:46,520 --> 00:27:47,760
It seems that

526
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:49,780
I'm not as dizzy as before.

527
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:51,930
We'll be there soon.

528
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,530
Get a proper checkup later.

529
00:27:56,120 --> 00:27:56,920
Gu Han.

530
00:27:57,520 --> 00:27:59,240
I'm really feeling much better now.

531
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,500
I don't think
I need to go to the hospital.

532
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:03,500
How about you drive back to my home

533
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:05,440
and have a meal with my parents?

534
00:28:06,520 --> 00:28:08,520
They haven't seen you in a long time.

535
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,840
Are you sure you're okay?

536
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:16,360
I should be fine
after resting for a while.

537
00:28:17,440 --> 00:28:19,240
If you don't want to go to my home,

538
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,680
we can go eat something else.

539
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:29,560
Tang Hui.

540
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,540
Did you lie to me on purpose

541
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,860
just because I wouldn't eat with you?

542
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:38,760
No.

543
00:28:38,800 --> 00:28:40,880
I was really dizzy just now.

544
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:42,370
Did you do it on purpose?

545
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:48,240
The training is over.

546
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:51,520
Are you still waiting to be summoned
by the campus TV station 24/7?

547
00:28:51,520 --> 00:28:52,680
Didn't you hate these interviews

548
00:28:52,680 --> 00:28:54,680
and stuff like that the most before?

549
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:10,480
If your foot is fine,

550
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,720
just go back by yourself.

551
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:12,650
Get out of my car.

552
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,440
Gu Han.

